    "font size" : 10.98,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "II.16. SUSPENSION OF THE PERFORMANCE OF THE CONTRACT"
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H1",
    "id" : 18,
    "level" : "Subtitle",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 455.964, 268.064, 469.253 ],
    "heading level" : 1,
    "font" : "Times New Roman Bold,Bold",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "II.16.1. Suspension by the contractor"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 19,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 414.428, 515.952, 439.228 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "If the contractor is affected by force majeure, it may suspend the performance of the contract."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 20,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 359.048, 515.964, 397.616 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The contractor must immediately notify the contracting authority about the suspension. The notification must include a description of the force majeure and state when the contractor expects to resume the performance of the contract."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 21,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 303.668, 515.812, 342.248 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The contractor must notify the contracting authority as soon as it is able to resume performance of the contract, unless the contracting authority has already terminated the contract."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H2",
    "id" : 22,
    "level" : "Subtitle",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 248.048, 502.716, 289.053 ],
    "heading level" : 2,
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "II.16.2. Suspension by the contracting authority The contracting authority may suspend the performance of the contract or any part of it:"
  }, {
    "type" : "list",
    "pdfua_tag" : "L",
    "id" : 23,
    "level" : "1",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 164.888, 515.812, 231.248 ],
    "numbering style" : "english letters",
    "number of list items" : 2,
    "list items" : [ {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 206.468, 515.812, 231.248 ],
      "font" : "Times New Roman",
      "font size" : 12.0,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "(a) if the procedure for awarding the contract or the performance of the contract proves to have been subject to substantial errors, irregularities or fraud;",
      "kids" : [ ]
    }, {
      "type" : "list item",
      "pdfua_tag" : "LI",
      "page number" : 1,
      "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 164.888, 515.8, 189.668 ],
      "font" : "Times New Roman",
      "font size" : 12.0,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "(b) in order to verify whether the presumed substantial errors, irregularities or fraud have actually occurred.",
      "kids" : [ ]
    } ]
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 24,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 79.38, 109.488, 515.904, 148.068 ],
    "font" : "Times New Roman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The contracting authority must formally notify the contractor of the suspension. Suspension takes effect on the day of formal notification, or at a later date if the formal notification so provides."
